    <string name="gg">Depending on the location, anglers may catch species such as perch, trout, walleye, pike, crappie, and other freshwater fish during the winter months.</string>
    <string name="h">What is an ice auger?</string>
    <string name="hh">An ice auger is a tool used to drill holes through thick ice. It can be manually operated or powered by gas, battery, or electric motors.</string>
    <string name="hide_bottom_view_on_scroll_behavior">com.google.android.material.behavior.HideBottomViewOnScrollBehavior</string>
    <string name="i">Do I need a fishing license for ice fishing?</string>
    <string name="icon_content_description">Dialog Icon</string>
    <string name="ii">In many regions, a valid fishing license is required for ice fishing. Regulations vary by location, so anglers should check local rules before fishing.</string>
    <string name="intro1_dec">A curated collection of the most popular and engaging games, featuring minimalist graphics and uniquely crafted levels that deliver a simple yet highly addictive gaming experience.</string>
    <string name="intro2">PLAY MINI GAMES</string>
    <string name="intro2_dec">Mini Games Puzzle Collection is an offline gaming hub packed with multiple fun and engaging mini games. No internet? No problem! Enjoy a variety of super casual games anytime, anywhere—whether you\'re on a long flight or without Wi-Fi. Stay entertained with diverse challenges designed to keep you playing for hours, all in one offline collection.</string>
    <string name="intro3">NO WIFI GAMES PUZZLES &amp; CASUAL MINI GAMES</string>
    <string name="intro3_dec">Love solving super casual mini games and logic puzzles without needing an internet connection? Mini Games is here to challenge your mind with a wide variety of exciting and engaging games—all in one place! From number-based logic puzzles to fun 1–4 player games and a mix of casual challenges, there’s something for everyone. Whether you\'re looking to pass time or sharpen your brain, this collection of offline games offers endless entertainment anytime, anywhere—no internet required.</string>
    <string name="item_view_role_description">Tab</string>
    <string name="j">Why do people enjoy ice fishing?</string>
    <string name="jj">People enjoy ice fishing because it offers a unique outdoor experience, peaceful surroundings, and the challenge of catching fish during winter conditions. It is also a popular social and recreational activity.</string>
